title: When processing a new node from magit, just worry about putting it everywhere it belongs.
pid: e3dcf01b-9b4a-48a3-baf5-b7ded724eae8
body: |2-
  Can then process its containers immediately.
  (Could help for this: A command to automatically staged its membership
  in each of its containers, wherever that line lies.
  But maybe one-line diff stagings can get confusing.)
